<title>USA: Coca-Cola Enterprises Inc Q1 loss vs net.</title>
<headline>Coca-Cola Enterprises Inc Q1 loss vs net.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.27   profit	 $0.04</p>
<p> Net loss		  33,000   profit	 7,000</p>
<p> Revs		   2,141,000		1,600,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 126,000		  126,000</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: 1997 net includes charge of $6 million, or $0.03/shr, related to debenture redeemption.</p>
<p>Cost of sales  $1.34 bln vs $970 million with 1996 number including gain of $10 million, or $0.05/shr after taxes, from settlement with certain suppliers.</p>
<p>Selling and administrative expenses $742 million vs $539 million.</p>
<p>Interest expense $107 million vs $79 million.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
